    `the day the payment was due under section 353, or the day the employer should have registered under section 379` IS YMD 2026 1 15,
    `the day of the insured event` IS YMD 2026 3 1, `the day the arrears were paid or the employer registered` IS YMD 2026 3 1,
    `the cash benefits the Institute paid or will pay` IS 30_000, `the money value of the benefits in kind given` IS 5_000
`a breach with the event on 1.3.2026 and the arrears paid on 1.3.2026, 48,000 cash, 5,000 in kind` MEANS `An employer's breach, for Schedule K1` WITH
