    `the day the payment was due under section 353, or the day the employer should have registered under section 379` IS YMD 2026 1 15,
    `the day of the insured event` IS YMD 2027 2 1, `the day the arrears were paid or the employer registered` IS YMD 2027 2 1,
    `the cash benefits the Institute paid or will pay` IS 300_000, `the money value of the benefits in kind given` IS 0
`a short breach, event and arrears paid on 30.1.2026, 30,000 cash` MEANS `An employer's breach, for Schedule K1` WITH
    `the day the payment was due under section 353, or the day the employer should have registered under section 379` IS YMD 2026 1 15,
    `the day of the insured event` IS YMD 2026 1 30, `the day the arrears were paid or the employer registered` IS YMD 2026 1 30,
    `the cash benefits the Institute paid or will pay` IS 30_000, `the money value of the benefits in kind given` IS 0
`a short breach, event and arrears paid on 30.1.2026, no benefits` MEANS `An employer's breach, for Schedule K1` WITH
    `the day the payment was due under section 353, or the day the employer should have registered under section 379` IS YMD 2026 1 15,
    `the day of the insured event` IS YMD 2026 1 30, `the day the arrears were paid or the employer registered` IS YMD 2026 1 30,
    `the cash benefits the Institute paid or will pay` IS 0, `the money value of the benefits in kind given` IS 0
`a breach with the event on 30.1.2026 and the arrears paid on 1.3.2026, 60,000 cash` MEANS `An employer's breach, for Schedule K1` WITH
    `the day the payment was due under section 353, or the day the employer should have registered under section 379` IS YMD 2026 1 15,
    `the day of the insured event` IS YMD 2026 1 30, `the day the arrears were paid or the employer registered` IS YMD 2026 3 1,
    `the cash benefits the Institute paid or will pay` IS 60_000, `the money value of the benefits in kind given` IS 0
`a breach with the event on 30.1.2026 and the arrears paid on 1.3.2026, 30,000 cash` MEANS `An employer's breach, for Schedule K1` WITH
    `the day the payment was due under section 353, or the day the employer should have registered under section 379` IS YMD 2026 1 15,
    `the day of the insured event` IS YMD 2026 1 30, `the day the arrears were paid or the employer registered` IS YMD 2026 3 1,
